WEBVTT

00:01.050 --> 00:02.370
She went that way!

00:02.370 --> 00:03.140
After her!

00:03.140 --> 00:04.740
Catch her no matter what!

00:13.620 --> 00:14.600
That way!

00:14.600 --> 00:15.200
Yes, sir!

00:16.350 --> 00:18.430
Wait! Don't go any further!

00:18.430 --> 00:19.520
What's the matter?

00:19.520 --> 00:22.010
Deep in this forest is the 
lair of the Demon Lord.

00:22.010 --> 00:23.390
The Demon Lord?

00:23.390 --> 00:26.710
Yes. Rumor says he hates humans,

00:26.710 --> 00:30.990
and anyone who approaches his lair 
is subject to his vicious violence.

00:31.810 --> 00:34.260
That's rather hard to believe...

00:34.260 --> 00:35.510
This way!

00:35.820 --> 00:38.220
A villager says he saw the wicked woman!

00:38.220 --> 00:39.270
Is that true?!

00:54.160 --> 00:58.590
<i>I'm sorry, Natalia... for taking 
off without explanation.</i>

00:58.590 --> 01:01.020
<i>But as long as I'm alive, I'm sure...</i>

01:07.380 --> 01:09.530
Natalia...

01:15.010 --> 01:19.600
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

02:43.300 --> 02:46.020
<b>Naughty Encounter</b>

02:49.020 --> 02:51.910
"Wicked Woman from 
Neighboring Nation Goes Missing:

02:51.910 --> 02:53.520
Did She Flee Abroad?"

02:56.100 --> 02:57.460
This presence...

03:08.790 --> 03:10.240
A monster?

03:28.430 --> 03:30.030
<i>She's light.</i>

03:30.030 --> 03:34.230
<i>I'd thought she might be a runaway, but 
maybe she'd fled from her abductor?</i>

03:34.230 --> 03:35.200
<i>For example...</i>

03:37.320 --> 03:39.030
From guys like these.

03:41.490 --> 03:43.360
That's some greeting.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.280
What?!

03:44.650 --> 03:46.800
It's elementary illusionary magic.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.140
From the Neruz Kingdom...

03:49.140 --> 03:52.510
And personal guards working directly 
for the royal family at that.

03:52.510 --> 03:56.490
So, what kind of business would someone 
of your status have around here?

04:01.760 --> 04:04.000
Hand over that woman.

04:04.000 --> 04:07.020
She's a major criminal who 
disgraced our nation.

04:07.840 --> 04:09.020
She is?

04:09.290 --> 04:14.940
I promise you, if you hand her over to 
us without fuss, we won't harm you.

04:14.940 --> 04:18.020
But if you interfere, we'll have no mercy!

04:18.020 --> 04:20.530
Hmm, I see.

04:20.530 --> 04:22.130
If that's the case, then...

04:22.990 --> 04:24.480
I refuse.

04:26.400 --> 04:29.920
Between you shady lot and 
a poor, emaciated girl...

04:30.240 --> 04:34.670
If anyone asks which side I'll be on, 
my answer's definitely the latter.

04:34.670 --> 04:37.690
H-He can't use his hands!

04:37.690 --> 04:39.180
Take him down all together!

04:39.660 --> 04:40.840
<i>"Ice Bind."</i>

04:40.090 --> 04:41.050
<b>Ice Bind</b>

04:40.090 --> 04:41.050
<b>Ice Bind</b>

