<b>Ice Bind</b>

04:40.090 --> 04:41.050
<b>Ice Bind</b>

04:40.090 --> 04:41.050
<b>Ice Bind</b>

04:40.090 --> 04:41.050
<b>Ice Bind</b>

04:47.810 --> 04:50.300
A n-nonverbal spell?!

04:54.320 --> 04:56.210
Your white and black hair!

04:56.210 --> 04:59.100
Are you the Demon Lord who 
lives in this forest?!

04:59.100 --> 05:00.160
The Demon Lord?!

05:00.160 --> 05:01.070
The real one?!

05:01.070 --> 05:03.330
No, not quite...

05:04.180 --> 05:05.810
I'm the <i>Great</i> Demon Lord!

05:05.810 --> 05:06.700
Phantom Dream!

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

