<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.070
<b>Phantom Dream</b>

05:10.460 --> 05:11.720
Let's see...

05:14.640 --> 05:16.340
What happened here?

05:16.340 --> 05:17.270
Tell me.

05:18.010 --> 05:21.080
We've searched the forest thoroughly...

05:21.080 --> 05:23.830
And the woman's trail was gone...

05:24.100 --> 05:26.730
So we concluded that she was 
attacked by a monster...

05:26.730 --> 05:29.840
And decided to go back home to report it.

05:29.840 --> 05:31.300
Well done.

05:40.500 --> 05:45.460
Their minds will soon be clear, and 
they'll have no memory of any of this.

06:00.180 --> 06:03.340
This is the major criminal the 
whole country is looking for?

06:03.340 --> 06:05.310
I find that hard to believe.

06:06.500 --> 06:09.360
<i>"Wicked Woman from 
Neighboring Nation Goes Missing."</i>

06:09.360 --> 06:13.300
<i>"A Scheme That Unfolded in 
Neruz Kingdom," huh...?</i>

06:20.120 --> 06:21.650
You're awake?

06:22.600 --> 06:24.520
W-Who might you be?

06:24.520 --> 06:25.390
Drink this.

06:25.840 --> 06:27.310
O-Okay...

06:31.880 --> 06:33.820
Why did you collapse?

06:33.820 --> 06:38.870
I got lost in the forest and 
saw a mansion in the distance.

06:38.870 --> 06:40.570
I tried to get there, and...

06:41.040 --> 06:43.010
This is that mansion.

06:43.940 --> 06:49.580
The fiancée to Neruz Kingdom's second 
prince, Miss Charlotte Evans.

06:50.450 --> 06:52.250
Th-That's not true.

06:52.250 --> 06:54.090
I-I...

06:54.660 --> 06:56.090
No need to be wary.

06:56.970 --> 07:00.610
I can tell if someone is lying 
by looking into their eyes.

07:00.970 --> 07:04.580
Charlotte, there's no trace 
of lies in your eyes.

07:06.850 --> 07:08.010
Huh?!

07:08.010 --> 07:09.490
Um, what's wrong?

07:09.490 --> 07:10.870
Are you hurt somewhere?

07:10.870 --> 07:15.920
You're... You're the first 
person to believe me...

07:19.140 --> 07:20.920
Are you feeling better?

07:20.920 --> 07:21.990
Yes...

07:21.990 --> 07:25.370
Would you tell me why you 
were exiled, Charlotte?

07:26.730 --> 07:29.710
It all happened so suddenly...

07:35.630 --> 07:38.670
Before we start the festivities, 
I have an announcement.

07:38.670 --> 07:41.400
Charlotte? Where is Charlotte?

07:41.400 --> 07:42.830
Who's Charlotte?

07:42.830 --> 07:47.890
She's a noble lady who has been betrothed 
to Prince Cecil for years now.

07:47.890 --> 07:50.180
I wasn't aware of her at all.

07:50.180 --> 07:54.660
Well, between you and me, there are rumors that she's the child of a mistress...

07:54.660 --> 07:59.150
I've never seen the two of them talk before.

08:03.080 --> 08:07.640
Charlotte, your evil deeds 
have come to light.

08:10.720 --> 08:14.310
<i>I had nothing to do with 
any of the accusations.</i>

08:14.310 --> 08:18.300
<i>But no one questioned the 
words of Prince Cecil.</i>

08:18.300 --> 08:23.320
Therefore, Charlotte Evans, I'm 
arresting you for treason.

08:23.590 --> 08:25.800
What?! Why...?!

08:25.800 --> 08:28.660
And our engagement is off.

08:28.660 --> 08:30.580
Take the wicked woman to prison!

08:30.580 --> 08:31.460
Yes, sir!

08:33.530 --> 08:37.130
Wait! Please, believe me!

08:37.130 --> 08:39.490
I didn't do anything!

08:45.190 --> 08:47.810
I really didn't do anything...

08:48.920 --> 08:51.510
<i>It's clear that she was framed.</i>

08:51.510 --> 08:55.610
<i>Either the prince didn't want to 
marry her, the child of a mistress,</i>

08:55.610 --> 08:58.090
<i>or perhaps there's another woman.</i>

08:58.090 --> 09:01.420
But you don't need to hear 
someone like me blabbering on.

09:01.420 --> 09:04.570
I truly appreciate your help.

09:05.350 --> 09:08.020
I won't bother you anymore.

09:08.020 --> 09:10.380
Before someone finds me 
here, I have to leave—

09:10.380 --> 09:11.950
Are you good at cleaning?

09:11.950 --> 09:12.750
Huh?

09:13.200 --> 09:16.010
As you can see, I'm rather bad at it.

09:16.010 --> 09:16.980
So?

09:16.980 --> 09:20.760
Um, I think I can manage as 
well as an average person...

09:21.400 --> 09:23.290
A perfect answer!

09:23.290 --> 09:25.500
I'm going to give you a job!

09:27.440 --> 09:29.900
The position is a live-in maid!

09:29.900 --> 09:30.700
Huh?!

09:30.700 --> 09:32.760
You'll be in charge of house chores.

09:33.110 --> 09:36.900
Of course I'll pay you, and you 
get three meals plus snacks.

09:36.900 --> 09:40.730
There are extra rooms here, so one 
more person isn't going to be—

09:40.730 --> 09:41.980
E-Excuse me?

09:41.980 --> 09:44.610
Were you listening to me just now?

09:44.610 --> 09:46.640
I'm a wanted criminal!

09:46.640 --> 09:48.490
<i>That's true.</i>

09:48.490 --> 09:52.440
<i>I live secluded deep in the forest, so 
I don't have to deal with other people.</i>

09:52.440 --> 09:55.510
<i>So harboring a fugitive defeats that purpose.</i>

09:55.510 --> 09:56.650
<i>Still...</i>

09:59.000 --> 10:04.080
The thing is, I've been betrayed by 
someone in the past, like you have.

10:04.080 --> 10:06.160
Oh, you too?

10:06.520 --> 10:09.180
I'm Allen. Allen Crawford.

10:09.700 --> 10:14.320
Three years ago, I was invited 
to join a certain party.

10:14.320 --> 10:19.170
Hoping for a fun adventure, I joined them.

10:19.640 --> 10:21.560
However...

10:22.050 --> 10:25.240
They used me to break the seal of a temple

10:25.240 --> 10:27.410
to steal the treasure they were looking for,

10:27.410 --> 10:29.860
and deserted me in front of a horde of monsters.

10:29.860 --> 10:33.620
They only meant to take advantage of me!

10:34.320 --> 10:37.210
Awful... That's just awful!

10:37.210 --> 10:39.080
To betray a friend?!

10:39.080 --> 10:42.100
<i>H-How is she so pure?!</i>

10:42.100 --> 10:45.200
<i>Believing in my story without hesitation?!</i>

10:45.660 --> 10:49.960
Back then, there was no 
one who would help me.

10:49.960 --> 10:54.200
That's why I just can't leave you alone. 
I think we have a lot in common.

10:54.740 --> 10:56.120
Allen...

10:57.650 --> 10:59.460
I appreciate your concern.

10:59.750 --> 11:02.640
But I will only cause you trouble.

11:02.640 --> 11:04.810
I cannot accept your offer.

11:04.810 --> 11:05.970
I see...

11:05.970 --> 11:08.260
Then here's the last resort.

11:10.980 --> 11:14.480
I just put a death curse on myself!

11:14.480 --> 11:15.740
What?!

11:16.350 --> 11:20.750
I won't lift the curse until 
you agree to work for me here!

11:22.680 --> 11:27.460
In other words, my heart
will stop in three minutes.

11:27.460 --> 11:28.750
I beg your pardon?!

11:28.750 --> 11:31.220
Now, you'd better make up your mind.

11:31.220 --> 11:36.490
Otherwise, an innocent civilian 
will die because of you.

11:36.490 --> 11:38.510
How did we get there?!

11:38.760 --> 11:41.560
Also, you're talking like a villain,

11:41.560 --> 11:45.250
but you're a nice person who's 
trying to save me, aren't you?

11:46.740 --> 11:49.280
Obviously I'm nothing but virtuous!

11:49.280 --> 11:51.250
Now, what say you, Charlotte?!

11:51.250 --> 11:53.400
You have two minutes and 31 seconds!

11:53.400 --> 11:55.170
If I may add...

11:55.170 --> 11:58.480
It's getting harder to breathe...!

11:58.480 --> 12:01.490
You must take better care of yourself!

12:01.490 --> 12:05.290
<i>And that's how I got Charlotte 
to agree to work here</i>

12:05.290 --> 12:08.200
<i>at this residence in less than a minute.</i>

12:08.990 --> 12:12.000
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

12:12.000 --> 12:15.000
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

12:16.660 --> 12:19.760
Allen, um...

12:19.760 --> 12:21.020
I'm finished.

12:21.020 --> 12:24.260
Oh, wow! What an amazing job you've done!

12:24.610 --> 12:27.090
It's hard to believe you're a 
noble lady from a Duke's family.

12:27.090 --> 12:30.100
I did help out a lot at home.

12:30.380 --> 12:34.350
<i>When I rescued Charlotte, I 
saw how rough her hands were.</i>

12:34.350 --> 12:36.560
<i>"Noble lady" was her title only,</i>

12:36.560 --> 12:39.910
<i>and in reality, she was 
perhaps more like a servant.</i>

12:39.910 --> 12:43.120
Also, all I did was polish the floor.

12:43.120 --> 12:47.420
You're the one who tidied 
stuff away using magic.

12:47.420 --> 12:50.410
Right, because everything was burnable.

12:50.650 --> 12:53.500
And you helped with cleaning the floor.

12:53.500 --> 12:55.660
Am I really necessary?

12:55.660 --> 12:57.310
Of course you are.

12:57.310 --> 13:00.190
You saw how messy the room was earlier.

13:00.190 --> 13:03.640
As you can see, I have 
zero housekeeping skills.

13:03.640 --> 13:06.930
Left alone, I don't even <i>think</i> of cleaning.

13:07.220 --> 13:10.670
Th-That's not something 
you should be proud of...

13:10.980 --> 13:12.440
It's the truth.

13:12.440 --> 13:14.890
It may be so, but...

13:14.890 --> 13:18.690
Um, what would you like me to do next?

13:19.010 --> 13:20.450
Let's see...

13:22.470 --> 13:23.950
For now, nothing.

13:24.180 --> 13:24.930
Huh?

13:25.250 --> 13:27.700
Do whatever you like until dinner.

13:29.530 --> 13:32.230
Don't you think I'd steal from you?

13:32.230 --> 13:33.950
There's no worry there.

13:33.950 --> 13:36.730
I went shopping in town yesterday 
to buy a bunch of stuff,

13:36.730 --> 13:38.960
so there's not much cash in this house.

13:38.960 --> 13:41.330
I'm sorry you had to buy things for me...

13:41.330 --> 13:43.090
It's called an initial investment.

13:43.090 --> 13:44.230
Don't worry about it.

13:44.720 --> 13:49.220
You can read books from the library 
or do gardening in the yard.

13:49.220 --> 13:50.330
Do whatever you like.

13:59.490 --> 14:02.170
I have to do some work.

14:02.170 --> 14:03.480
Do not disturb me.

14:06.740 --> 14:08.890
Of course...

14:11.010 --> 14:15.120
<i>I can't ignore someone in trouble, 
but I hate being social.</i>

14:15.480 --> 14:17.930
<i>She may feel a debt of gratitude to me now,</i>

14:17.930 --> 14:20.580
<i>but in time, she'll be fed 
up with me and leave.</i>

14:21.260 --> 14:25.960
<i>When the time is right, perhaps I'll 
leave some money in a conspicuous place.</i>

14:26.560 --> 14:30.320
<i>Now, it's time for one 
of my very few hobbies.</i>

14:30.320 --> 14:33.820
<i>Here's the research paper on magical theory 
that was presented a few days ago.</i>

14:33.820 --> 14:36.500
<i>I'll find holes in it and riddle 
it with my corrections!</i>

14:39.140 --> 14:44.780
<i>Apparently, they fear me as the "Red Pen Devil" at academic conferences.</i>

14:44.780 --> 14:48.440
<i>Which gets me even more excited 
to meet their expectations.</i>

14:53.910 --> 14:56.370
Oh, look at the time.

14:57.280 --> 14:59.100
Time to turn on the lights.

15:00.560 --> 15:01.240
Whoa!

15:01.240 --> 15:05.870
20511... 20512...

15:03.200 --> 15:05.870
Ch-Charlotte, what are you doing?

15:06.310 --> 15:07.600
Allen.

15:07.600 --> 15:10.590
Since you said I could do anything I liked,

15:10.590 --> 15:12.890
I was counting the grains in the wood floor.

15:13.280 --> 15:14.710
<i>The grains in <i>what</i>?!</i>

15:14.710 --> 15:18.900
<i>Even if you are bored to death, 
who would actually do that?!</i>

15:19.540 --> 15:22.190
Charlotte, there's something 
I'd like to ask you.

15:22.190 --> 15:23.370
Do you have hobbies?

15:23.370 --> 15:24.650
Hobbies?

15:25.080 --> 15:28.140
Hm, nothing in particular.

15:28.140 --> 15:31.650
Th-Then what did you do in 
your free time at home?

15:32.000 --> 15:38.690
Um, when I wasn't doing my bridal training, 
I was cleaning and mending clothes.

15:38.690 --> 15:40.930
So I really didn't have any free time.

15:40.930 --> 15:43.920
<i>What a sad thing to say with a smile!</i>

15:43.920 --> 15:47.680
Then what did you enjoy about your 
bridal training or whatever it was?

15:47.680 --> 15:53.920
Well, I didn't particularly "enjoy" it, since I 
got yelled at all the time for making mistakes.

15:54.300 --> 15:57.240
Th-Then tell me any of your recent fond memories?

15:57.240 --> 15:58.740
I do have that!

15:58.740 --> 15:59.670
Oh!

16:00.140 --> 16:04.650
Two months ago, Natalia... my 
little sister gave me some fruit.

16:04.650 --> 16:06.690
It was a little bruised,

16:06.690 --> 16:10.710
but I don't get to eat such treats 
very often, so I was very happy—

16:10.710 --> 16:14.330
Um, Allen? Why does your face look so scary?

16:14.650 --> 16:16.730
This is the face I was born with!

16:16.730 --> 16:17.700
Don't worry about it!

16:18.390 --> 16:21.730
<i>Even </i>I<i> got to enjoy fun times at 
the magical academy every day,</i>

16:21.730 --> 16:28.210
<i>like making professors tear up by 
bombarding them with questions,</i>

16:28.210 --> 16:31.200
<i>and blowing up classrooms 
in potion experiments.</i>

16:31.490 --> 16:34.810
<i>She should be having the 
best time of her life.</i>

16:34.810 --> 16:38.470
<i>And yet, she has no hobbies or 
fun memories. Not to mention...</i>

16:40.220 --> 16:41.720
Okay, I've decided!

16:41.720 --> 16:47.220
Charlotte, I'm going to give you a crash 
course on all things naughty in the world!

16:47.620 --> 16:48.560
I beg your pardon?

16:50.090 --> 16:51.490
I'm home!

16:52.140 --> 16:55.190
Um, what is all this?

16:55.560 --> 16:59.010
You said you didn't have much cash...

16:59.010 --> 17:00.330
Have no fear.

17:00.330 --> 17:02.060
I sold my magical equipment.

17:02.060 --> 17:03.990
It sold for a sizable amount of money.

17:04.270 --> 17:06.670
Do you remember that I told you I was going

17:06.670 --> 17:09.790
to give you a crash course on all 
things naughty in the world?

17:09.790 --> 17:11.500
Yes, you did say that, but...

17:11.800 --> 17:13.530
What do you mean by "naughty"?

17:13.530 --> 17:15.500
It means joy and pleasure.

17:15.500 --> 17:17.510
But what I meant by that is...

17:18.500 --> 17:21.310
The immoral type of pleasure.

17:22.250 --> 17:25.710
Naughty things are fun.

17:25.710 --> 17:27.030
Addictingly so.

17:29.310 --> 17:33.750
You are an honest and genuine 
person, a rarity these days.

17:33.750 --> 17:37.520
I bet you've never spoken up 
against the Duke's family?

17:37.520 --> 17:43.530
I mean... they're nice enough to let 
me stay there, so I wouldn't dare...

17:43.850 --> 17:47.580
<i>Speaking like they're her 
master, not her family.</i>

17:47.580 --> 17:50.530
<i>It's unhealthy if you ask me. So...</i>

17:50.530 --> 17:53.790
I shall teach you something naughty.

17:55.620 --> 18:01.530
You will indulge in pleasure, turning into 
a beast that loses herself to impulses!

18:01.530 --> 18:03.800
You are scaring me, Allen!

18:04.070 --> 18:07.630
Also... we are not supposed 
to do bad things!

18:08.780 --> 18:11.990
Don't you worry, we won't 
do anything illegal.

18:11.990 --> 18:14.660
We'll do something naughty 
that even virtuous wives,

18:14.660 --> 18:19.370
strict teachers, and exemplary 
clergies get obsessed with.

18:19.370 --> 18:22.820
What is that naughty thing?

18:23.180 --> 18:24.520
I will teach you.

18:24.520 --> 18:26.470
Now, burn this into your memory!

18:26.870 --> 18:29.040
The first naughty thing is...

18:32.170 --> 18:33.320
Cakes?

18:33.700 --> 18:35.830
It's too soon to be surprised.

18:38.660 --> 18:40.850
Um... what's this?

18:41.130 --> 18:42.680
Today's dinner!

18:42.680 --> 18:45.020
Eat, drink, and be merry 
to your heart's content!

18:45.020 --> 18:47.390
This is today's naughty thing!

18:49.610 --> 18:50.750
What?!

18:50.750 --> 18:53.230
B-B-But this is bad, Allen!

18:53.230 --> 18:55.580
You have to eat a proper dinner!

18:55.580 --> 18:58.370
If you only eat sweets, it'll 
lead to an unbalanced diet!

18:58.370 --> 19:02.400
Hm, an exemplary response as I expected.

19:02.400 --> 19:04.860
That makes it worth corrupting you.

19:05.380 --> 19:09.080
They didn't feed you properly 
at the Duke's, did they?

19:09.080 --> 19:10.470
That's...

19:10.470 --> 19:12.850
<i>They must have treated her 
as family on the surface,</i>

19:12.850 --> 19:15.880
<i>but in reality handled her like a servant.</i>

19:16.270 --> 19:18.640
I was told this is the most 
popular menu item at the store.

19:18.640 --> 19:21.800
Here, a sweet cake!

19:22.170 --> 19:26.450
B-But! You can't have a cake for dinner!

19:26.450 --> 19:30.380
And I can't possibly be 
indebted to you even more...

19:30.380 --> 19:34.240
Hmm... but it is such a pretty cake.

19:34.240 --> 19:36.940
How would the pâtissier 
feel if you didn't eat it?

19:37.800 --> 19:41.370
Plus, who is your employer right now?

19:41.370 --> 19:42.780
It's you, Allen...

19:43.440 --> 19:44.800
Exactly!

19:44.800 --> 19:47.320
And you <i>must</i> obey your employer's orders!

19:48.080 --> 19:50.800
So today, you must have 
your fill of these cakes.

19:50.800 --> 19:52.730
That's your job.

19:52.730 --> 19:54.290
That's crazy...

19:54.560 --> 19:59.010
If you plan to resist more, then 
I'll put on the death curse again...

19:59.010 --> 20:00.870
on <i>myself</i>, of course!

20:01.290 --> 20:04.870
I told you to please take 
better care of yourself!

20:04.870 --> 20:06.150
Okay, fine.

20:06.150 --> 20:07.810
I will gratefully eat it!

20:07.810 --> 20:10.550
That's what you should 
have done to begin with.

20:10.820 --> 20:12.930
Well then, thank you for the food.

20:12.930 --> 20:13.970
But...

20:14.460 --> 20:17.040
Please take your pick first, Allen.

20:17.040 --> 20:19.580
I'll take whatever is left.

20:19.820 --> 20:22.650
No, I don't like sweets.

20:22.650 --> 20:23.490
What?!

20:23.490 --> 20:26.430
Did you buy all of these for me, then?

20:26.430 --> 20:28.070
You just realized that?

20:28.070 --> 20:30.650
And you had to come up with money to do so?!

20:30.650 --> 20:33.080
W-Why did you do something like that?!

20:33.390 --> 20:34.850
Why?

20:34.850 --> 20:37.090
Because I thought it 
would make you happy...?

20:39.390 --> 20:40.420
What's the matter?

20:40.420 --> 20:42.710
Do you not like sweets either?

20:42.710 --> 20:44.390
O-Oh no, I love them!

20:44.390 --> 20:46.000
Then start eating already.

20:46.730 --> 20:47.340
Okay...

20:48.840 --> 20:51.340
For me...

20:55.620 --> 20:56.950
H-How is it?

20:56.950 --> 20:57.780
Is it good?

20:58.220 --> 20:59.440
It's delicious...

20:59.440 --> 21:00.370
Is that so?

21:03.620 --> 21:05.960
You didn't like the taste?

21:05.960 --> 21:07.610
N-No, that's not it.

21:08.370 --> 21:12.370
For someone to do something 
like this for me...

21:13.790 --> 21:15.870
To be nice to me...

21:16.340 --> 21:19.210
I've never experienced that before.

21:19.720 --> 21:24.630
Is someone like me allowed to be this happy?

21:26.920 --> 21:28.230
Stop being ridiculous.

21:28.230 --> 21:30.370
You think <i>this</i> is happiness?

21:30.370 --> 21:31.630
Don't make me laugh.

21:31.940 --> 21:33.760
This is only the beginning.

21:34.130 --> 21:38.170
Starting now, I will teach you every 
single pleasure in this world.

21:38.170 --> 21:40.650
You can yell and cry, but 
I will show no mercy.

21:43.280 --> 21:44.230
I have decided.

21:44.690 --> 21:49.550
I'll stuff you with delicious food and 
take you to many places around the world.

21:49.550 --> 21:53.160
I'll make you experience fun and happy 
things until you're bored of it.

21:53.440 --> 21:56.800
And eventually, I'll turn you into
someone who can proudly say that

21:56.800 --> 21:58.920
you're the happiest person in the world.

21:59.700 --> 22:04.110
Why are you being so nice to 
a total stranger like me?

22:04.110 --> 22:05.220
Beats me.

22:05.220 --> 22:06.670
I don't know why.

22:06.930 --> 22:10.230
But if I'm going to do it, 
I will do so thoroughly!

22:10.230 --> 22:11.850
I swear to you!

22:11.850 --> 22:14.220
As long as you are by my side,

22:14.220 --> 22:17.670
I'm going to teach you everything there is 
to know about the naughty things in the world.

22:18.200 --> 22:21.680
B-But, I don't have any way 
to return your favor!

22:21.680 --> 22:23.980
There is no need for that.

22:23.980 --> 22:27.940
Just think that you're being forced 
to go along with my hobby.

22:29.480 --> 22:31.950
You are kind, yet so strange.

22:32.300 --> 22:34.280
Here, there's more.

22:34.280 --> 22:35.090
Eat up.

22:35.090 --> 22:37.410
I can't eat that much.

22:37.410 --> 22:39.200
Would you like some, Allen?

22:39.470 --> 22:41.430
I told you I don't like...

22:43.250 --> 22:44.710
I mean...

22:44.710 --> 22:47.470
I'd hate for it to go to waste, 
so I'll have some with you.

22:47.470 --> 22:51.220
Yes! I'm sure it'd be much 
tastier if we eat it together!

22:53.880 --> 22:55.720
Hmm, it's not so bad.

22:56.110 --> 22:58.230
Here, you try this too.

22:58.920 --> 23:00.260
Ah...

23:03.380 --> 23:05.230
It's tasty...

23:06.200 --> 23:07.870
Th-That's good to hear...

23:11.680 --> 23:15.160
<i>I don't like to be social, but 
I guess I'll have to try.</i>

23:17.570 --> 23:19.890
Come on, don't be shy.

23:25.890 --> 23:28.890
So that's the Demon Lord...

23:30.520 --> 23:31.730
Listen, Charlotte.

23:31.730 --> 23:34.000
When the fist makes contact, 
you turn your wrist in!

23:34.000 --> 23:35.600
Hit it, hit it, hit it!

23:35.600 --> 23:37.570
Next Episode: "Naughty Way to Release Stress."

23:36.020 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:36.020 --> 23:40.010
<b>Naughty Way to Release Stress</b>

23:37.570 --> 23:40.100
What is this training for?!
